# Ctrl+B bolds the word at the caret, shows the markers while editing and hides them in navigate mode.
file <<END
- Read chapter three today
END
see Read chapter three today
keys <Enter> <A-b> <A-b> <C-b>
see - Read chapter **three** today
keys <Esc>
see - Read chapter three today
quit
saved <<END
- Read chapter **three** today
END
